      "contextFingerprint": "38e3e681e67df2ea6c3a7147e006c071d6918ba7494da045ce11e8e3c8453840",
      "sourceText": "*   **name** （必填）：为关节命名，名称需要唯一。\n\n*   **type** （必填）：设置关节类型，可用类型如下：\n\n    *   continuous：旋转关节，可以绕单轴无限旋转。\n\n    *   revolute：旋转关节，类似于 continues，但是有旋转角度限制。\n\n    *   prismatic：滑动关节，沿某一轴线移动的关节，有位置极限。\n\n    *   planer：平面关节，允许在平面正交方向上平移或旋转。\n\n    *   floating：浮动关节，允许进行平移、旋转运动。\n\n    *   fixed：固定关节，不允许运动的特殊关节。",
      "translatedText": "*   **name** (required): Name the joint; the name must be unique\\.\n\n*   **type** (required): Set the joint type\\. The available types are as follows:\n\n    *   continuous: A revolute joint that can rotate indefinitely about a single axis\\.\n\n    *   revolute: A revolute joint similar to continuous, but with limits on the rotation angle\\.\n\n    *   prismatic: A sliding joint that moves along an axis and has position limits\\.\n\n    *   planar: A planar joint that allows translation or rotation in orthogonal directions within a plane\\.\n\n    *   floating: A floating joint that allows translational and rotational motion\\.\n\n    *   fixed: A fixed joint, a special joint that does not allow motion\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 247,
        "outputTokens": 142,
        "costUsd": 0.000245
      }
    },
